Du må bare hoppe.

363
00:18:14,218 --> 00:18:17,179
Hva er det? Heineken? Moosehead?

364
00:18:18,889 --> 00:18:21,475
Fra gode, gamle Latrobe.

365
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,478
Rolling Rock. Pent.

366
00:18:29,274 --> 00:18:30,609
Har fått fire morfin.

367
00:18:31,276 --> 00:18:32,361
Hvordan er smerten?

368
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:33,820
Nede til åtte.

369
00:18:33,821 --> 00:18:36,365
Der. Lateral STEMI. Si ifra.

370
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:38,116
Var elektrodene for lavt?

371
